WEBVTT

01:32.240 --> 01:34.680
Xuanqing ranked third in the exams.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.920
We ought to celebrate.

01:37.560 --> 01:39.160
But he won't hear of any fuss

01:39.440 --> 01:40.920
and I dare not press the matter.

01:41.720 --> 01:43.200
Still, appearances

01:43.200 --> 01:44.280
must be kept.

01:44.680 --> 01:45.960
I thought to

01:45.960 --> 01:47.039
invite

01:47.560 --> 01:49.080
Mrs. Yu

01:49.080 --> 01:51.160
and Wanxue to dine with us.

01:51.880 --> 01:52.920
What say you?

01:52.920 --> 01:54.080
Mother's word is law.

01:54.320 --> 01:55.680
No objections.

01:56.120 --> 01:57.880
Those are your own words.

01:58.720 --> 02:00.120
Then I shall

02:00.880 --> 02:02.960
find you a match as well.

02:04.720 --> 02:05.720
So Mother's been

02:05.840 --> 02:07.120
setting a trap for me.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.360
What nonsense.

02:09.639 --> 02:10.759
I am nothing like you lot,

02:11.360 --> 02:13.320
all cunning and hidden schemes.

02:14.160 --> 02:14.920
Tell me true,

02:15.240 --> 02:16.880
are you still

02:18.320 --> 02:19.160
mourning

02:19.280 --> 02:21.360
your late wife?

02:22.000 --> 02:24.520
She was here

02:24.880 --> 02:27.000
but two years.

02:27.760 --> 02:28.560
You have mourned her

02:28.560 --> 02:29.880
long enough.

02:30.600 --> 02:31.600
To carry on

02:32.040 --> 02:33.280
is too much!

02:33.680 --> 02:35.440
It is not that.

02:36.280 --> 02:38.400
I've simply been consumed by duties.

02:38.720 --> 02:39.960
Yet even Xuanqing

02:39.960 --> 02:41.640
is taking a bride now.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.640
And you, his uncle,

02:43.640 --> 02:45.400
remain utterly alone...

02:46.600 --> 02:47.320
Then...

02:47.840 --> 02:49.800
allow me to assist.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.440
Whose daughter

02:53.320 --> 02:56.240
has caught your favor?

02:57.480 --> 02:58.440
Here we are again...

02:59.800 --> 03:00.800
She needn't come

03:01.280 --> 03:02.920
from a grand house.

03:04.480 --> 03:04.920
So...

03:04.920 --> 03:05.560
Forgive the intrusion.

03:08.440 --> 03:09.760
There's a pressing matter with the Gus.

03:12.640 --> 03:13.200
Mother,

03:13.560 --> 03:14.880
I must

03:15.360 --> 03:16.240
take my leave.

03:17.040 --> 03:18.360
Every time marriage comes up,

03:18.360 --> 03:19.240
something urgent appears.

03:19.440 --> 03:20.040
Enjoy.

03:20.400 --> 03:21.560
Off with you.

03:26.880 --> 03:28.200
Since the Baoxiang Temple murders,

03:28.440 --> 03:29.800
the bureau's been

03:29.800 --> 03:30.800
watching this gang.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.600
They made arrests just days ago.

03:33.160 --> 03:34.040
And sent a list:

03:34.040 --> 03:34.880
the gang itself,

03:34.880 --> 03:36.040
plus everyone

03:36.200 --> 03:37.120
linked to their dealings.

03:37.480 --> 03:38.360
I went through it,

03:38.520 --> 03:39.240
and there was

03:39.240 --> 03:40.160
Ms. Gu's own brother.

03:40.480 --> 03:41.520
I pressed a little further.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.680
Word is, he operates

03:43.680 --> 03:45.280
a gambling den.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.160
A few from this gang

03:47.320 --> 03:48.600
were his regulars.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.640
A classic Ji, I must say.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.280
No deal too dirty for that lot.

03:52.720 --> 03:53.840
From what we've gathered,

03:54.320 --> 03:55.079
Master Gu

03:55.240 --> 03:55.880
certainly had no clue

03:55.880 --> 03:56.880
who he was dealing with.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.560
So when does the bureau

03:59.800 --> 04:01.040
plan to wrap this up?

04:01.200 --> 04:01.920
Lord Zhang

04:02.080 --> 04:02.960
wants to move fast,

04:03.200 --> 04:04.440
but wanted to check with you first.

04:04.680 --> 04:06.080
Moving fast is the right call.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.200
In that case,

04:07.520 --> 04:09.240
go tip off Ms. Gu.

04:09.560 --> 04:10.120
My lord.

04:13.480 --> 04:14.000
On second thought...

04:15.400 --> 04:16.600
tell her

04:16.760 --> 04:18.519
I need to see her in person.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.440
No matter what,

04:20.680 --> 04:21.519
we have to meet.

04:23.880 --> 04:24.400
Yes, my lord.

04:24.600 --> 04:25.280
Go.

04:32.680 --> 04:33.400
Ms. Gu,

04:33.960 --> 04:34.520
this way.

04:36.120 --> 04:36.880
Gratitude.

04:37.000 --> 04:38.240
Stay put.

04:38.480 --> 04:38.960
My lady.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.240
Greetings, my lord.

04:54.840 --> 04:55.720
No formalities.

04:56.360 --> 04:57.680
This concerns your brother,

04:58.120 --> 04:59.080
and it is no small matter.

04:59.280 --> 04:59.920
So

05:00.440 --> 05:01.800
I wanted to meet you in person.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.360
How can you be certain

05:07.600 --> 05:08.720
he was unaware

05:08.720 --> 05:09.760
of his clients' true nature?

05:10.320 --> 05:12.080
I knew all along

05:12.360 --> 05:13.720
he was a gambling tout.

05:14.320 --> 05:15.760
But with our mother gravely ill,

05:15.960 --> 05:17.240
I chose to say nothing.

05:18.160 --> 05:19.280
Forgive me if it sounds foolish,

05:19.720 --> 05:20.920
but he never...

05:21.000 --> 05:21.920
cared much for studies.

05:22.080 --> 05:23.280
He has a taste for trade.

05:24.520 --> 05:26.000
Our family forbade it,

05:26.320 --> 05:27.560
and so... he strayed.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.960
But to say he conspired with outlaws...

05:30.320 --> 05:31.320
he would never dare!

05:31.720 --> 05:32.560
Can you vouch for that?

05:33.080 --> 05:34.280
I'd stake my life on it.

05:36.600 --> 05:37.400
As for

05:38.120 --> 05:39.040
those outlaws,

05:39.400 --> 05:40.000
the bureau's set to

05:40.000 --> 05:41.400
make their move within days.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.400
If you want to get him out,

05:44.000 --> 05:44.960
you must act quickly.

05:47.080 --> 05:48.240
I am deeply grateful.

05:48.640 --> 05:49.840
Time and again,

05:49.840 --> 05:51.200
you've shown us

05:51.600 --> 05:52.480
such generosity.

05:52.880 --> 05:54.520
I'm forever in your debt!

05:54.880 --> 05:55.880
Think nothing of it.

05:56.640 --> 05:57.720
As for those...

05:57.960 --> 05:59.680
rather peculiar gifts...

06:00.440 --> 06:01.480
Please, no more of those.

06:09.040 --> 06:09.880
Well......

06:13.440 --> 06:14.120
And this...

06:14.720 --> 06:15.720
is also for me?

06:18.560 --> 06:19.000
I...

06:19.680 --> 06:20.880
It's...

06:23.560 --> 06:24.640
You brought it,

06:24.880 --> 06:25.800
so leave it.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.480
What is it this time?

07:13.960 --> 07:14.760
The last time...

07:15.040 --> 07:16.240
when you came

07:16.240 --> 07:17.320
to my aid...

07:18.240 --> 07:19.240
you left it behind.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.120
I brought it home

07:21.120 --> 07:22.520
and found a few tears in it,

07:23.240 --> 07:24.240
so I had it repaired

07:24.560 --> 07:26.160
with golden thread...

07:26.880 --> 07:28.200
But it still

07:28.640 --> 07:29.760
didn't look right...

07:30.040 --> 07:31.560
so I had it reembroidered...

07:46.240 --> 07:47.040
Remarkable.

08:15.840 --> 08:16.720
Then I shall

08:17.520 --> 08:18.520
gladly keep it.

08:20.280 --> 08:21.040
Yes, my lord.

08:29.840 --> 08:31.400
What's taking Mr. Ping so long?

08:33.200 --> 08:34.679
Stop!

08:36.919 --> 08:37.520
Mr. Ping!

08:37.799 --> 08:38.400
Qingpu,

08:38.640 --> 08:39.440
they've taken

08:39.440 --> 08:40.600
Master Gu!

08:40.679 --> 08:42.000
At first,

08:42.320 --> 08:44.440
he only wanted a few customers.

08:44.640 --> 08:46.000
Earn a little extra on the sly.

08:46.760 --> 08:47.880
But then he heard,

08:48.200 --> 08:49.760
if you lease the place

08:49.760 --> 08:51.120
and turn it over,

08:51.640 --> 08:53.120
you could take an extra cut.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.840
Then he thought... why not.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.120
Why not?

08:59.040 --> 09:00.560
You useless fool!

09:02.120 --> 09:03.960
My son, MY SON!

09:04.400 --> 09:05.320
Was touting

09:05.640 --> 09:07.600
for a gambling den!

09:08.440 --> 09:09.200
What is this?

09:10.040 --> 09:11.720
That is greed rotting a man

09:12.040 --> 09:14.280
from the inside!

09:14.520 --> 09:15.160
Father,

09:15.400 --> 09:16.920
I've already sent Mr. Ping

09:16.920 --> 09:18.320
and the men after them.

09:18.680 --> 09:19.600
Shall we

09:19.760 --> 09:20.840
go to the authorities?

09:21.440 --> 09:22.360
Absolutely not...

09:22.760 --> 09:23.800
not the authorities!

09:25.040 --> 09:25.720
Jinrong was taken

09:26.120 --> 09:28.360
from a gambling den.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.320
What a disgrace!

09:30.480 --> 09:31.440
Report it,

09:31.440 --> 09:32.560
and we proclaim to all

09:33.040 --> 09:35.520
that my son consorted with gamblers.

09:36.000 --> 09:36.680
No, no.

09:36.680 --> 09:37.800
Absolutely not!

09:39.000 --> 09:39.840
My lord!

09:40.960 --> 09:41.640
My lord,

09:41.880 --> 09:42.600
something terrible...

09:42.880 --> 09:43.480
My lady heard that

09:43.480 --> 09:44.520
Master Gu has been taken...

09:44.520 --> 09:45.400
she has fainted!

09:45.400 --> 09:46.160
What?

09:47.400 --> 09:48.720
I told everyone

09:48.720 --> 09:50.080
she was not to know a word of it!

09:50.080 --> 09:51.440
I swear I didn't say a word...

10:04.520 --> 10:05.240
This way.

10:22.880 --> 10:23.880
How did Mother find out

10:24.080 --> 10:25.200
that Jinrong was taken?

10:25.760 --> 10:27.400
I was walking with her in the garden

10:27.640 --> 10:28.680
when two servants

10:28.680 --> 10:29.600
started gossiping,

10:30.040 --> 10:31.440
saying Master Gu

10:31.560 --> 10:32.720
had been seized.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.560
She asked them what happened,

10:34.760 --> 10:36.240
and then she collapsed.

10:39.080 --> 10:39.840
Jinzhao,

10:41.320 --> 10:42.440
how is she?

10:43.360 --> 10:44.200
She's taken the remedies.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.120
She is resting now.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.280
Thank heaven for that.

10:47.960 --> 10:48.880
But Jinrong...

10:49.040 --> 10:49.760
I heard

10:49.760 --> 10:51.000
he was abducted!

10:52.560 --> 10:53.440
And who

10:53.440 --> 10:54.200
told you that?

10:55.320 --> 10:56.920
Everyone's talking about it!

11:00.200 --> 11:01.640
Jinrong was taken. Yes.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.280
And this was supposed to stay quiet,

11:03.440 --> 11:04.720
especially from Mother.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.120
Someone

11:06.120 --> 11:07.400
let it slip.

11:07.760 --> 11:08.600
Who is it?

11:10.120 --> 11:10.960
Hard to say.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.440
But I'd start by asking

11:13.920 --> 11:15.240
who has the most to gain.

11:28.560 --> 11:29.920
Is Chunlin even trustworthy?

11:29.920 --> 11:30.920
What if he slips up!

11:31.200 --> 11:32.120
Have no fear.

11:32.480 --> 11:33.760
We are close.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.080
He won't betray me.

11:35.760 --> 11:36.320
Besides,

11:36.680 --> 11:38.200
Jinrong was snatched

11:38.200 --> 11:38.800
in broad daylight.

11:39.000 --> 11:39.920
Half the city saw it.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.040
Nobody will trace it back to us.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.520
Good.

11:44.240 --> 11:45.360
And Jinrong, honestly,

11:45.680 --> 11:46.680
his mother's fortune

11:46.680 --> 11:47.680
is practically a goldmine.

11:47.680 --> 11:48.760
That's not enough for him?

11:49.240 --> 11:50.840
He had to tout for a gambling den,

11:50.960 --> 11:52.280
trading in that sort of filth.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.440
No wonder his mother fainted.

11:54.440 --> 11:56.160
I'd faint just hearing about it.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.240
Lan...

12:01.000 --> 12:01.560
Tell me the truth.

12:01.800 --> 12:02.560
Was it you who

12:02.560 --> 12:03.360
spread word of this

12:03.600 --> 12:04.720
until she collapsed in despair?

12:05.160 --> 12:06.080
Outrageous!

12:06.840 --> 12:07.680
Guard your tongue...

12:07.920 --> 12:08.480
That's right.

12:09.040 --> 12:10.640
We only just found out ourselves.

12:10.840 --> 12:11.520
My lady,

12:11.520 --> 12:12.920
you grieve your mother unjustly!

12:14.120 --> 12:15.040
Then good.

12:15.640 --> 12:17.120
Jinrong's fate hangs by a thread.

12:17.320 --> 12:17.840
Mind yourselves,

12:17.840 --> 12:19.000
do not fan these flames!

12:19.080 --> 12:20.200
Am I the one

12:20.360 --> 12:21.560
on trial?

12:21.880 --> 12:22.960
I gave you life.

12:23.240 --> 12:24.600
Is this how you repay me?

12:24.880 --> 12:25.640
If rage consumes you,

12:25.760 --> 12:26.640
do not bring it

12:26.800 --> 12:27.680
to my door!

12:44.400 --> 12:45.000
Lord Chen

12:45.000 --> 12:46.080
has learned of your plight.

12:46.400 --> 12:47.120
Should aid be needed,

12:47.320 --> 12:48.240
present this

12:48.360 --> 12:49.320
to the capital garrison

12:49.320 --> 12:50.240
and seek out Lord Hu.

13:03.680 --> 13:04.160
Boss,

13:04.600 --> 13:06.120
how big's our cut this time?

13:07.400 --> 13:08.280
Easy, easy.

13:08.360 --> 13:09.520
You'll all get yours.

13:25.560 --> 13:26.080
Sir!

13:27.320 --> 13:27.800
Where is he?

13:28.080 --> 13:29.040
Woodshed.

13:30.560 --> 13:31.080
Go.

13:32.560 --> 13:33.920
Li Xianhuai...

13:57.800 --> 13:58.600
Mother...

14:01.880 --> 14:03.040
Is Jinrong back yet?

14:03.480 --> 14:04.480
Don't worry.

14:05.760 --> 14:07.120
Everyone is out looking.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.080
Mr. Luo

14:08.080 --> 14:09.280
has a whole search party out.

14:09.800 --> 14:10.880
And Lord Chen

14:11.080 --> 14:12.080
is on it too.

14:13.880 --> 14:14.640
Alright.

14:19.600 --> 14:20.240
My lady...

14:28.360 --> 14:29.400
I'll be back.

14:31.120 --> 14:32.880
It was really Li Xianhuai?

14:33.480 --> 14:34.040
Yes.

14:34.320 --> 14:35.640
I would've run back last night,

14:35.640 --> 14:36.400
but the city gates

14:36.520 --> 14:37.840
were already closed.

14:38.760 --> 14:40.040
Li Xianhuai is

14:40.040 --> 14:41.360
Master Ye's guard.

14:41.840 --> 14:42.560
So does that mean...

14:42.760 --> 14:44.240
Master Ye's the one behind it?

14:45.880 --> 14:46.720
My lady!

14:47.240 --> 14:47.960
My lady!

14:49.240 --> 14:50.200
What is it?

14:52.520 --> 14:53.200
Word just

14:53.320 --> 14:54.120
came from

14:54.120 --> 14:55.000
Master Ye.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.120
He says Master Gu has been found!

14:56.360 --> 14:57.360
He's sending him back now!

15:00.440 --> 15:01.200
Oh, Mother...

15:01.400 --> 15:02.440
I was so terrified...

15:05.720 --> 15:06.280
Mother,

15:06.720 --> 15:08.200
Mr. Li is the reason

15:08.200 --> 15:09.000
I'm alive.

15:09.880 --> 15:12.040
I cannot thank you enough.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.720
Please, come in

15:15.520 --> 15:16.120
for some tea.

15:16.120 --> 15:16.880
Gratitude.

15:17.000 --> 15:17.520
But I must return

15:17.520 --> 15:18.560
to Master Ye.

15:18.800 --> 15:19.560
I shouldn't linger.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.000
Another time,

15:21.280 --> 15:22.000
we'll

15:22.200 --> 15:24.360
give you the thanks you deserve.

15:34.000 --> 15:35.280
Here, my son.

15:40.280 --> 15:41.240
Enough!

15:43.600 --> 15:44.400
Father...

15:44.680 --> 15:46.000
He was held by those men

15:46.000 --> 15:47.080
through the night...

15:47.080 --> 15:48.520
He's been through enough.

15:48.520 --> 15:50.160
The lesson is learned.

15:50.760 --> 15:52.160
Is that not sufficient?

15:53.680 --> 15:55.040
The lesson is learned.

15:55.040 --> 15:56.480
Such simple wisdom!

15:57.160 --> 15:58.080
Do you know

15:58.080 --> 15:59.320
what this wretch has cost me?

15:59.520 --> 16:01.840
The censor has denounced me!

16:02.960 --> 16:04.400
How did the censor learn of it?

16:04.640 --> 16:06.880
It's an unlicensed gambling den,

16:07.120 --> 16:09.240
no papers, no trace.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.720
Soldiers moved in last night,

16:11.720 --> 16:13.120
tore it apart.

16:13.440 --> 16:15.280
Ledgers showed it

16:15.840 --> 16:18.040
clear as day:

16:18.200 --> 16:20.080
Gu Jinrong's name.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.920
The keeper confessed all:

16:24.480 --> 16:27.480
the boy's father

16:27.880 --> 16:30.440
heads the Treasury,

16:30.440 --> 16:32.160
so he got special terms:

16:32.400 --> 16:34.360
a private room, discounted.

16:34.840 --> 16:36.760
He's lying!

16:37.080 --> 16:39.280
Your name. In ink.

16:39.280 --> 16:40.600
With your handprint.

16:40.800 --> 16:42.760
And you call him a liar?

16:43.800 --> 16:45.520
Were it not for Lord Chen,

16:45.520 --> 16:48.000
who vouched for you,

16:48.000 --> 16:48.880
you'd already

16:49.800 --> 16:52.480
be standing before a judge!

16:53.400 --> 16:54.280
Rather than

16:54.720 --> 16:56.160
let you

16:56.280 --> 16:57.760
bring this house to ruin,

16:58.360 --> 16:59.400
today

17:01.440 --> 17:02.400
I will

17:02.400 --> 17:04.440
beat you

17:04.680 --> 17:06.040
into the ground!

17:07.319 --> 17:07.920
Mother!

17:11.680 --> 17:12.680
- Mother!
- Father...

17:13.280 --> 17:13.839
My lord!

17:13.839 --> 17:14.240
Please!

17:14.480 --> 17:15.280
My lord...

17:16.000 --> 17:16.560
Father!

17:16.800 --> 17:17.599
Stop...

17:17.599 --> 17:18.280
My lord,

17:18.560 --> 17:19.560
mercy...

17:20.000 --> 17:20.800
Dozens of lashes already...

17:20.800 --> 17:22.160
It will kill him!

17:22.160 --> 17:23.240
Out of my way!

17:24.200 --> 17:25.000
My lady...

17:25.240 --> 17:26.640
- Not another word for him!
- Mother...

17:27.440 --> 17:29.000
And you...

17:29.560 --> 17:30.840
I was just getting to you.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.080
This family has a legacy!

17:32.720 --> 17:35.560
Scholarship, honor.

17:35.840 --> 17:37.000
Our relatives' children...

17:37.000 --> 17:37.920
scholars, everyone!

17:38.080 --> 17:40.000
Not a single exception!

17:41.240 --> 17:42.560
And then there's him!

17:46.440 --> 17:47.400
So you're saying...

17:48.520 --> 17:50.000
it's all on me?

17:50.160 --> 17:51.440
Isn't it!

17:52.040 --> 17:54.400
You Jis...

17:54.400 --> 17:56.360
raised on money,

17:56.360 --> 17:59.240
not values!

17:59.880 --> 18:02.160
No wonder

18:02.840 --> 18:05.680
I've got a son like this!

18:06.920 --> 18:08.160
Father, do you hear yourself?

18:08.680 --> 18:10.120
Your return to office,

18:10.600 --> 18:12.440
paid for by the Jis, every last coin.

18:13.040 --> 18:13.960
Currently,

18:14.320 --> 18:16.000
house's contents: food, garb, all...

18:16.200 --> 18:16.920
which escapes

18:16.920 --> 18:18.400
Mother's funds?

18:19.440 --> 18:21.120
You despise us that much?

18:21.240 --> 18:22.400
Then starting today,

18:22.800 --> 18:24.640
hand over your salary.

18:24.920 --> 18:26.080
All of it.

18:26.160 --> 18:26.960
We shall see

18:27.080 --> 18:28.160
how far that

18:28.160 --> 18:29.480
actually gets you.

18:30.120 --> 18:30.960
- Jinzhao...
- Oh,

18:31.320 --> 18:32.440
and your account

18:32.560 --> 18:33.080
at the Jis' shops.

18:33.080 --> 18:34.560
Art, antiques.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.000
Settle every last bit.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.440
How dare...

18:37.520 --> 18:39.400
you say that!

18:40.480 --> 18:41.480
You see this?

18:41.560 --> 18:42.760
Your children!

18:43.760 --> 18:44.880
Both of them,

18:45.160 --> 18:46.800
son and daughter...

18:47.040 --> 18:48.240
greed is all they know,

18:49.160 --> 18:51.440
haggling over

18:51.440 --> 18:53.240
every last farthing!

18:55.000 --> 18:56.560
You're crying?

18:56.560 --> 18:58.320
I should be the one in tears!

19:00.160 --> 19:02.760
I attained the pinnacle

19:03.080 --> 19:04.920
of scholarly honor!

19:05.160 --> 19:08.760
Yet no heir to bear it onward!

19:09.960 --> 19:11.040
My fault...

19:11.840 --> 19:13.240
All mine...

19:14.680 --> 19:15.880
It's on me...

19:18.000 --> 19:19.120
My Lady!

19:19.360 --> 19:19.960
Mother...

19:22.920 --> 19:23.760
My Lady!

19:24.680 --> 19:25.520
My Lady!

19:25.520 --> 19:26.240
Are you all right?

19:27.440 --> 19:28.240
- Mother...
- My lady!

19:28.480 --> 19:29.200
Mother!

19:32.600 --> 19:33.440
My lady!

20:30.800 --> 20:31.960
Ms. Jinzhao's here.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.080
My lady,

20:38.760 --> 20:40.880
please stay with her.

20:41.560 --> 20:43.560
She woke in the night

20:44.520 --> 20:45.720
and hasn't slept since.

20:45.720 --> 20:46.640
Just sitting there.

20:47.120 --> 20:48.280
Staring out.

20:49.360 --> 20:50.560
I am

20:50.560 --> 20:51.600
at a loss.

20:52.360 --> 20:53.760
Did my lord come?

20:54.080 --> 20:55.200
Just left.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.360
He apologized.

20:57.840 --> 20:58.520
But she

20:58.520 --> 20:59.880
didn't say a word

21:00.760 --> 21:01.960
in return.

21:03.040 --> 21:04.360
He lost patience

21:04.800 --> 21:06.600
and stormed out.

21:08.520 --> 21:09.280
I see.

21:19.880 --> 21:20.640
Mother...

21:23.080 --> 21:23.960
Darling,

21:24.480 --> 21:25.160
come,

21:25.560 --> 21:26.320
sit with me.

21:34.520 --> 21:36.400
What beautiful hands.

21:38.440 --> 21:41.440
When we sent you to Tongzhou,

21:43.080 --> 21:44.080
they were

21:44.480 --> 21:45.920
this big.

21:47.840 --> 21:48.920
It was

21:49.720 --> 21:51.400
this time of year...

21:53.240 --> 21:55.080
How I wish I could go back...

22:03.000 --> 22:04.600
My lord says it's time.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.320
I'm to take the child.

22:08.520 --> 22:09.320
My lady...

22:10.400 --> 22:11.160
Where is she?

22:11.320 --> 22:12.520
Get her out now!

22:26.960 --> 22:27.800
My love,

22:28.320 --> 22:29.360
give me the child.

22:30.000 --> 22:30.880
My lord.

22:31.640 --> 22:32.760
She's barely

22:33.360 --> 22:35.160
one month old.

22:37.400 --> 22:39.000
After all I endured

22:39.000 --> 22:40.240
carrying her...

22:40.720 --> 22:42.360
can you wait a little longer?

22:42.600 --> 22:43.440
I am sending her

22:43.440 --> 22:45.280
to her grandmother.

22:45.640 --> 22:47.560
Not selling her off.

22:47.840 --> 22:49.480
What is there to fear?

22:53.000 --> 22:54.920
I had her fate read.

22:54.920 --> 22:56.920
Her stars are ill-suited to mine.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.280
Should she stay,

22:58.840 --> 23:00.280
it would cost me my career,

23:00.520 --> 23:02.040
and do her no good either.

23:03.280 --> 23:04.560
Sending her away

23:05.200 --> 23:06.800
is in her own interest.

23:09.960 --> 23:11.240
In yours, you mean.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.960
Enough of this.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.400
Hand her over!

23:16.000 --> 23:17.040
My lord...

23:17.040 --> 23:18.040
- be gentle, please!
- Give her here!

23:18.200 --> 23:18.840
My lord...

23:21.600 --> 23:22.360
please...

23:22.840 --> 23:23.520
My lord...

23:23.840 --> 23:25.200
Hear me out!

23:25.360 --> 23:26.920
Wait, please!

23:31.640 --> 23:34.320
My child!

23:35.000 --> 23:36.000
No, no!

23:36.000 --> 23:36.600
My lady...

23:36.760 --> 23:37.480
- No!
- My lady...

23:37.640 --> 23:38.440
My lord!

23:38.600 --> 23:39.400
- My lady...
- Please...

23:39.840 --> 23:41.920
You've barely left childbed.

23:42.800 --> 23:43.800
My baby!

23:44.280 --> 23:46.080
Jinzhao!

23:47.720 --> 23:50.080
Jinzhao!

23:55.800 --> 23:58.080
What possessed me?

23:58.080 --> 24:00.120
Why did I ever trust his word?

24:01.000 --> 24:02.600
I stood there and watched...

24:02.600 --> 24:05.520
as he took you away!

24:17.120 --> 24:18.000
Jinzhao...

24:18.560 --> 24:19.640
Forgive me...

24:20.000 --> 24:21.240
Forgive me.

24:22.320 --> 24:24.160
I failed you, my child.

24:25.800 --> 24:27.280
If I've wronged

24:28.040 --> 24:29.640
anyone in this life...

24:29.960 --> 24:31.160
it's you...

24:32.920 --> 24:34.200
I'm sorry...

24:35.400 --> 24:36.960
forgive me...

24:38.120 --> 24:40.080
The greatest sin of my life

24:41.200 --> 24:42.920
was committed

24:43.760 --> 24:45.040
against you.

24:46.680 --> 24:48.960
I'll carry this guilt

24:49.680 --> 24:52.160
to my grave...

25:07.520 --> 25:08.480
Mother...

26:49.640 --> 26:51.520
[The greatest sin of my life]

26:52.640 --> 26:54.240
[was committed]

26:54.400 --> 26:55.400
[against you.]

27:17.560 --> 27:18.160
[Mother...]

27:33.440 --> 27:34.000
My lady,

27:36.320 --> 27:37.280
you're in tears...

27:37.800 --> 27:38.600
It's nothing.

27:40.240 --> 27:41.920
Dust in my eyes.

27:45.600 --> 27:47.440
Go to Lord Changxing's.

27:47.960 --> 27:48.800
Find Li Xianhuai.

27:50.640 --> 27:51.560
Tell him

27:54.560 --> 27:56.320
I wish to thank Master Ye

27:57.080 --> 27:58.240
for bringing Jinrong home.

28:01.800 --> 28:03.160
I shall treat him to wine.

28:08.720 --> 28:09.680
Those were her words?

28:09.960 --> 28:10.400
Yes, my lord.

28:10.880 --> 28:12.040
she requests the pleasure

28:12.040 --> 28:12.960
of your company,

28:13.160 --> 28:14.120
at your leisure.

28:17.360 --> 28:18.440
At last.

28:19.320 --> 28:21.000
Worth every bit of trouble.

28:23.600 --> 28:24.880
Greetings, Master Ye.

28:25.720 --> 28:27.560
My gratitude for saving my brother.

28:27.760 --> 28:28.280
Such etiquette.

28:28.280 --> 28:29.320
I'm not sure

28:29.880 --> 28:30.720
I know this lady.

28:31.600 --> 28:34.000
Your kindness demands a worthy return.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.640
You've done my family

28:35.640 --> 28:36.640
an enormous favor.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.480
You deserve proper gratitude.

28:52.080 --> 28:53.440
Awfully quiet in here.

28:54.520 --> 28:55.960
Few customers at this hour.

28:57.000 --> 28:58.040
Which suite

28:58.360 --> 28:59.520
have you arranged?

29:00.320 --> 29:01.520
Our finest.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.640
We do not

29:02.640 --> 29:03.640
open it

29:04.080 --> 29:05.000
for just anyone.

29:05.000 --> 29:06.280
But today,

29:06.520 --> 29:07.680
you are not

29:07.920 --> 29:09.000
just anyone.

29:12.440 --> 29:12.960
Lead the way.

29:13.520 --> 29:14.080
Mr. Li,

29:14.920 --> 29:16.560
My lady has prepared

29:16.560 --> 29:17.640
a separate suite

29:17.920 --> 29:19.720
for you and your men.

29:20.320 --> 29:20.960
I...

29:22.360 --> 29:22.800
Enjoy yourselves.

29:23.080 --> 29:23.600
Yes, my lord.

29:23.840 --> 29:24.400
Gentlemen.

29:26.760 --> 29:27.480
After you.

29:38.840 --> 29:39.440
What manner of game

29:39.440 --> 29:40.520
is this now?

29:41.240 --> 29:42.040
Tell me,

29:42.920 --> 29:44.200
you took Jinrong.

29:44.840 --> 29:46.000
Then you let him go.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.000
What were you after?

29:49.720 --> 29:50.680
You found out.

29:51.160 --> 29:52.120
How?

29:52.880 --> 29:53.760
Someone told you?

29:55.840 --> 29:56.960
Don't tell me

29:57.760 --> 29:58.920
it was Chen Yanyun...

30:00.440 --> 30:01.040
You two keep

30:01.040 --> 30:02.280
finding each other remarkably often.

30:02.760 --> 30:03.560
So

30:03.960 --> 30:04.840
that's a yes.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.240
Every bit of it.

30:08.040 --> 30:08.680
Yes,

30:09.040 --> 30:09.840
I did it.

30:10.280 --> 30:10.960
Why?

30:11.960 --> 30:12.680
He never did

30:12.680 --> 30:13.680
a single thing to you!

30:13.880 --> 30:15.040
Why would you go after him?

30:15.800 --> 30:16.920
No reason.

30:17.840 --> 30:18.520
It diverted me.

30:26.960 --> 30:27.960
Oh, there it is.

30:28.520 --> 30:29.800
The real you!

30:34.040 --> 30:35.200
You left me no choice.

30:36.360 --> 30:37.200
Master Ye,

30:38.240 --> 30:39.680
I cannot fathom

30:40.000 --> 30:41.360
why you took him.

30:42.320 --> 30:43.760
Nor can I fathom you,

30:43.920 --> 30:44.960
not even after all this time.

30:46.320 --> 30:47.280
Every time I begin to think

30:47.280 --> 30:47.800
perhaps there is

30:47.800 --> 30:48.960
something decent in you,

30:49.680 --> 30:50.360
you do something

30:50.360 --> 30:51.880
that defies all reason.

30:52.400 --> 30:53.120
So forgive me

30:53.840 --> 30:54.960
for meeting madness with madness.

30:55.240 --> 30:56.280
Lest one day

30:57.000 --> 30:58.200
you burn my house down

30:58.560 --> 30:59.560
simply because the mood struck you.

31:00.000 --> 31:00.920
Is that genuine confusion,

31:00.920 --> 31:02.080
or are you putting it on?

31:02.560 --> 31:03.240
Pardon?

31:03.560 --> 31:04.560
Everything I did.

31:04.920 --> 31:06.080
I did it for you.

31:07.120 --> 31:07.920
What do you mean?

31:10.200 --> 31:11.440
The boy is barely grown

31:11.440 --> 31:13.040
and he's already touting for gambling dens.

31:13.560 --> 31:15.080
A scolding changes nothing.

31:15.760 --> 31:16.520
If you actually

31:17.160 --> 31:18.280
want him to stop,

31:18.800 --> 31:20.400
you shake him.

31:21.160 --> 31:21.920
Hard enough

31:22.240 --> 31:23.520
that it sticks.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.520
That's the only way.

31:25.960 --> 31:27.000
That was

31:27.320 --> 31:28.360
your reasoning?

31:29.800 --> 31:31.120
What business is it of yours?

31:31.120 --> 31:32.040
Because!

31:35.320 --> 31:36.120
Because...

31:36.120 --> 31:37.520
you are fearless in every matter

31:38.040 --> 31:39.040
except when

31:39.040 --> 31:40.280
it concerns your own blood.

31:41.760 --> 31:43.120
You saved my life once.

31:44.040 --> 31:45.600
I had no worthy means of repayment.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.880
So let me handle the part

31:48.520 --> 31:49.240
you couldn't

31:49.240 --> 31:50.440
bring yourself to do.

31:50.960 --> 31:52.400
And I was measured about it.

31:53.080 --> 31:54.720
After what he endured,

31:55.080 --> 31:55.840
he will not

31:55.840 --> 31:57.000
go near a gambling den again.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.560
Do you even realize

32:00.960 --> 32:02.360
because of what you did,

32:02.880 --> 32:03.800
my mother

32:03.920 --> 32:05.120
collapsed.

32:08.680 --> 32:09.480
Her health

32:09.480 --> 32:10.680
was already fragile.

32:11.520 --> 32:12.320
And then Jinrong...

32:12.320 --> 32:13.160
this whole thing...

32:13.360 --> 32:14.520
pushed her over the edge.

32:14.960 --> 32:15.960
She hasn't

32:16.560 --> 32:17.760
left her bed since yesterday.

32:21.400 --> 32:21.920
I...

32:24.240 --> 32:25.040
I had no idea.

32:25.800 --> 32:27.000
I was only trying to help...

32:27.000 --> 32:28.080
Well, thank you for that!

32:28.320 --> 32:29.440
Don't help me again.

32:32.320 --> 32:33.600
How dare you, woman!

32:33.880 --> 32:34.640
Untie me this instant!

32:35.000 --> 32:36.480
Your brother's the one

32:36.960 --> 32:37.960
who put your mother in bed!

32:39.360 --> 32:41.000
I only meant to help.

32:45.400 --> 32:46.240
There it is.

32:46.920 --> 32:47.880
I struck a nerve.

32:49.160 --> 32:49.800
Snap at me?

32:49.800 --> 32:51.120
Go fix your brother first.

32:52.480 --> 32:54.360
So I'm the only one

32:55.000 --> 32:56.520
you dare lash out at!

32:59.600 --> 33:00.400
Stay down.

33:00.400 --> 33:01.440
You've earned it!

33:03.560 --> 33:04.320
Gu Jinzhao!

33:04.760 --> 33:05.640
Hey!

33:51.120 --> 33:51.680
Master,

33:52.640 --> 33:53.840
I looked into it.

33:54.320 --> 33:55.360
The gambling den

33:55.360 --> 33:56.280
wasn't raided

33:56.280 --> 33:57.000
over paperwork.

33:57.400 --> 33:58.400
It was raided on suspicion

33:58.400 --> 33:59.920
of harboring some outlaws.

34:00.680 --> 34:01.400
The garrison

34:01.400 --> 34:02.840
carried out the operation,

34:03.360 --> 34:04.080
but the order

34:04.400 --> 34:05.640
came from the bureau.

34:06.720 --> 34:07.720
And the garrison

34:07.720 --> 34:08.840
sent men

34:08.840 --> 34:09.679
specifically for Master Gu.

34:10.320 --> 34:12.639
It seems Lord Chen was the one

34:12.639 --> 34:13.400
who arranged for that.

34:55.760 --> 34:56.719
The whole trip

34:56.719 --> 34:57.640
paid off.

34:58.040 --> 34:58.800
I came upon

34:59.080 --> 35:00.080
a herb farmer,

35:00.640 --> 35:02.160
a man who knew

35:02.160 --> 35:03.320
Mr. Xiao well.

35:04.600 --> 35:06.120
He spoke of his gift

35:06.120 --> 35:07.400
for medicine

35:07.800 --> 35:08.600
with

35:08.760 --> 35:09.800
great admiration.

35:10.240 --> 35:10.920
People practically

35:10.920 --> 35:11.720
revered him for it.

35:12.560 --> 35:14.080
One night,

35:14.080 --> 35:15.080
after too much wine,

35:15.320 --> 35:16.480
he let slip that

35:16.480 --> 35:18.320
he was from Xianghe.

35:19.200 --> 35:20.040
And behind his house

35:20.200 --> 35:21.200
stood a temple.

35:21.880 --> 35:22.680
As a boy,

35:22.680 --> 35:24.440
he used to slip inside and steal offerings.

35:25.080 --> 35:26.600
A temple in Xianghe.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.080
Could it be Xuanmiao Temple?

35:32.040 --> 35:32.920
My thoughts precisely.

35:33.720 --> 35:35.440
The temple holds royal patronage.

35:35.960 --> 35:37.200
Royals have long dedicated

35:37.200 --> 35:38.600
their children there since birth.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.120
Prince Chengqing was no exception.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.000
And his appearance?

35:42.000 --> 35:43.120
Was anything said of that?

35:43.560 --> 35:45.480
The sort of face one forgets.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.200
One thing only,

35:47.560 --> 35:48.960
a small growth on his left ear.

35:50.640 --> 35:51.120
My lord.

35:52.840 --> 35:54.120
A letter from Lord Zhang.

36:12.120 --> 36:13.120
Zhang Ling has broken them.

36:13.800 --> 36:14.720
Over 200

36:14.720 --> 36:15.920
of them in total.

36:16.160 --> 36:16.960
Divided into five cells.

36:17.160 --> 36:18.680
Each one in the dark about the others.

36:19.080 --> 36:20.160
A single courier

36:20.360 --> 36:21.520
moves between them.

36:21.520 --> 36:22.680
Passes instructions.

36:23.040 --> 36:23.960
Nobody knows

36:24.160 --> 36:24.680
where this

36:24.680 --> 36:26.000
courier lives.

36:27.720 --> 36:28.760
Only one detail

36:29.960 --> 36:31.480
slipped out:

36:32.120 --> 36:33.080
he consumes no meat.

36:33.400 --> 36:34.440
A strict vegan.

36:38.520 --> 36:39.120
Send word

36:40.040 --> 36:41.480
to Lord Zhang.

36:41.760 --> 36:42.560
Look into the temple.

36:43.120 --> 36:43.720
My lord.

37:33.400 --> 37:34.120
Darling...

37:34.120 --> 37:35.440
no more healers.

37:35.760 --> 37:36.760
It serves nothing.

37:40.480 --> 37:42.160
They all write

37:43.160 --> 37:44.680
the same prescriptions.

37:47.400 --> 37:48.400
Sit up, lie down,

37:49.160 --> 37:50.160
sit up again.

37:51.560 --> 37:54.000
If Death has marked my name,

37:54.440 --> 37:56.400
no remedies will spare me.

37:58.240 --> 37:59.000
Mother,

37:59.600 --> 38:00.600
please.

38:01.120 --> 38:02.400
The healer said

38:02.800 --> 38:04.200
it is not so grave.

38:05.080 --> 38:06.760
You simply need time.

38:07.360 --> 38:09.000
Let yourself heal.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.040
What is it?

38:19.200 --> 38:19.920
I was just assigned

38:19.920 --> 38:21.280
to look after the young master.

38:21.680 --> 38:22.320
This was... found

38:22.560 --> 38:23.600
beneath his pillow.

38:39.360 --> 38:40.680
[It is I who brought this upon Mother.]

38:41.200 --> 38:42.280
[Upon all of you.]

38:42.840 --> 38:43.960
[From this day forward,]

38:44.400 --> 38:45.600
[forget that I ever existed.]

38:46.280 --> 38:47.400
That miserable,

38:48.160 --> 38:49.520
ungrateful boy!

38:51.240 --> 38:52.480
Has he...

38:52.680 --> 38:54.000
run away?

38:54.800 --> 38:55.480
Father,

38:55.640 --> 38:56.840
we shall find him!

38:56.920 --> 38:57.880
For what?

38:58.720 --> 38:59.680
He will keep

39:00.400 --> 39:01.840
making trouble until

39:02.320 --> 39:04.520
this family is ruined!

39:04.760 --> 39:05.640
Let him go!

39:06.040 --> 39:06.560
Good riddance

39:06.720 --> 39:08.040
to him!

39:09.240 --> 39:09.960
Father,

39:10.240 --> 39:11.080
this is not the moment

39:11.280 --> 39:12.760
for words you'll regret!

39:14.040 --> 39:14.760
Qingpu,

39:15.160 --> 39:16.200
find Mr. Ping.

39:16.760 --> 39:17.960
Take everyone we have.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.400
Whoever finds him

39:19.600 --> 39:20.360
will be handsomely rewarded.

39:20.720 --> 39:21.920
My lady!

39:26.120 --> 39:26.880
Chunlin,

39:27.360 --> 39:28.920
send our men as well.

39:29.000 --> 39:29.520
At once.

39:38.600 --> 39:40.320
[The temple holds royal patronage.]

39:40.960 --> 39:42.000
[Without an imperial edict,]

39:42.360 --> 39:42.920
[the bureau]

39:42.920 --> 39:44.400
[has no grounds to conduct a search.]

39:45.000 --> 39:46.120
[We will need a pretext.]

39:51.440 --> 39:53.280
His Highness' charm has been

39:53.280 --> 39:54.560
ready for a while.

39:55.320 --> 39:57.080
We were planning to send it

39:57.080 --> 39:58.400
at the start of next month.

39:58.800 --> 40:01.640
We did not expect to see you.

40:01.880 --> 40:04.000
It's the Crown Prince's charm.

40:04.400 --> 40:05.200
Coming in person

40:05.480 --> 40:06.400
was the right thing to do.

40:08.800 --> 40:10.840
These beads

40:11.120 --> 40:13.720
are a small gift.

40:14.280 --> 40:16.920
Nothing of great worth,

40:17.480 --> 40:18.440
but they've been

40:18.440 --> 40:21.200
blessed by the gods.

40:21.800 --> 40:22.760
Gratitude.

40:25.600 --> 40:26.440
Lord Zhang!

40:28.480 --> 40:29.440
Something tells me

40:29.640 --> 40:31.640
you are looking for someone.

40:41.480 --> 40:43.040
You see right through me.

40:43.240 --> 40:44.520
I'll be plain about it.

40:45.200 --> 40:46.680
Has anyone of a suspicious nature

40:46.800 --> 40:48.680
been seen recently?

40:49.560 --> 40:50.880
What sort of person?

40:51.600 --> 40:53.200
Someone suspected of... sedition.

40:56.440 --> 40:57.280
No.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.360
We have

40:58.360 --> 41:00.120
47 members of staff in total.

41:00.400 --> 41:03.440
All have been registered

41:03.560 --> 41:05.000
with the authorities.

41:05.480 --> 41:06.800
And beyond those people?

41:07.160 --> 41:08.960
Casual laborers,

41:09.240 --> 41:10.160
kitchen hands?

41:10.720 --> 41:11.800
None whatsoever.

41:12.080 --> 41:15.480
Given the royals' connection to us,

41:15.680 --> 41:17.400
we cannot afford to be careless.

41:18.080 --> 41:20.440
They are all trustworthy.

41:20.440 --> 41:22.880
Even the farmers who deliver our vegetables

41:23.080 --> 41:25.040
are from households down the hill.

41:26.200 --> 41:27.320
Unless...

41:28.920 --> 41:29.560
My child,

41:30.600 --> 41:33.160
have there been any outsiders lately?

41:35.560 --> 41:36.680
Yes, Master.

41:37.120 --> 41:38.720
There has been a devotee.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.000
What does he look like?

41:40.240 --> 41:41.920
Thin. Dark complexion.

41:42.640 --> 41:43.240
Oh,

41:43.480 --> 41:44.680
there's a growth

41:44.680 --> 41:45.720
on his left ear.

41:46.200 --> 41:47.200
He told me

41:47.440 --> 41:49.080
he calls it his doorstop.

41:50.480 --> 41:51.600
Where is he now?

41:51.840 --> 41:53.000
He just left.

41:53.320 --> 41:54.640
Right when you were arriving.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.960
He cannot have gone far.

42:08.400 --> 42:09.160
Ride hard,

42:09.560 --> 42:10.440
we may still catch him!

42:14.680 --> 42:15.400
Ambush!

42:23.840 --> 42:24.720
Cover your faces!

42:44.920 --> 42:45.520
My lord!

43:04.320 --> 43:05.000
What's happened?

43:05.360 --> 43:06.080
My lady,

43:06.560 --> 43:07.640
a wheel gave out.

43:08.160 --> 43:09.240
We won't be moving

43:09.240 --> 43:10.040
any time soon.

43:10.920 --> 43:11.720
There's

43:12.080 --> 43:13.400
an abandoned shed just ahead.

43:13.600 --> 43:14.600
Let's take shelter there.

43:24.120 --> 43:25.280
The rain is letting up.

43:29.440 --> 43:30.880
Listen carefully,

43:31.400 --> 43:32.880
whoever finds Jinrong

43:33.280 --> 43:35.000
gets 100 taels of silver.

43:35.280 --> 43:36.480
Yes, my lady!

43:44.640 --> 43:45.240
My lord,

43:45.760 --> 43:46.840
we're almost there.

43:56.720 --> 43:57.640
Lord Chen?

44:02.000 --> 44:02.560
My lord,

44:02.960 --> 44:03.720
brace yourself.

44:14.560 --> 44:15.160
My lady,

44:15.560 --> 44:16.760
should I lend a hand?

44:17.920 --> 44:18.880
I'll go.

44:21.480 --> 44:22.120
Let me.

44:31.280 --> 44:32.240
I'm grateful, my lady.

44:52.600 --> 44:54.000
[How did he end up like this...]
